# A Windows checkout must not rewrite line endings. scripts/abi-sizes.txt is diffed byte for byte
# against the layout probe's own output, and a CRLF copy of it makes all 111 lines differ while
# reading identically -- which is exactly how it failed. The shell scripts have the same stake.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.a   binary
*.lib binary
*.c3l binary
